  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Intern kontroll granskning, bidrag nr. 14312 praktisk handling</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Internal control Review, contribution No 14312 practical action - Internal Control and Management Review- Practical Action</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This assignment aims at assessing the system for internal control of Practical Action Sudan. The assignment will primarily focus on an analysis of the internal control systems at the country office in Sudan, in order to determine whether these can guarantee quality and accuracy. In addition, the consultant shall submit recommendations in respect of improvements deemed necessary.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Uppdraget syftar till att bed&#xf6;ma systemet f&#xf6;r intern kontroll av praktiska &#xe5;tg&#xe4;rder Sudan. Uppdraget kommer i f&#xf6;rsta hand att inriktas p&#xe5; en analys av de interna kontrollsystemen p&#xe5; landets kontor i Sudan, f&#xf6;r att avg&#xf6;ra om dessa kan garantera kvalitet och noggrannhet. Dessutom ska konsulten l&#xe4;mna rekommendationer om f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttringar som bed&#xf6;ms n&#xf6;dv&#xe4;ndiga.</narrative>
  </description>
